  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "The vector $\\overset{\\to }{ST}$ has magnitude $6.$ Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overset{\\to }{ST}?$",
  "worked_solution": "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overset{\\to }{ST},$ we divide $\\overset{\\to }{ST}$ by its length:\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{\\overset{\\to }{ST}}{|\\overset{\\to }{ST}|}=\\frac{1}{6}\\overset{\\to }{ST}\n$$",
